  "text8": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2Wide"
    },
    "text": "Why we wanted one queue"
   }
  },
  "text9": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "leadWide"
    },
    "text": "For years every team ran its own broker, its own retry rules and its own dashboards. Moving to a single queue was less about speed than about being able to reason about the whole system."
   }
  },
  "text10": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "Forty services meant forty slightly different ideas of what a failed message is. Some retried forever, some dropped work silently, and a few did both depending on the day. When an incident crossed team lines, nobody could say where a message had been.",
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide"
    }
   }
  },
  "text11": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "We started by writing down the guarantees we actually needed: at-least-once delivery, per-key ordering and a dead-letter path that a human can read. Everything else was negotiable.",
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide"
    }
   }
  },
  "column12": {
   "type": "column",
   "layout": {
    "padding": [
     20,
     8,
     0,
     8
    ],
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "spacing": 8,
    "crossAxisAlignment": "start"
   },
   "decoration": {
    "strokes": [
     {
      "color": "primary"
     }
    ],
    "strokeSides": "left"
   },
   "children": [
    "text12",
    "text13"
   ]
  },
  "text12": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "“The queue did not remove our failures. It made every one of them visible, in one place, in the same shape.”",
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide",
     "fontSize": 22,
     "fontWeight": 600
    }
   }
  },
  "text13": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "mutedWide"
    },
    "text": "Priya Nair"
   }
  },
  "text14": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2Wide"
    },
    "text": "How the migration worked"
   }
  },
  "text15": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "text": "We moved one service at a time behind a thin client library. The library hid the broker, enforced a common envelope and attached a trace id to every message, so old and new paths could run side by side.",
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide"
    }
   }
  },
